  "version": 1,
  "about": "Technology taxonomy for retrieval priors and project detection. aliases name the technology outright and steer retrieval strongly (other technologies are demoted); hints only suggest it (a small boost, no demotion). Both are whole-phrase matches on normalized prompt text (lowercase; X.js -> xjs, c++ -> cpp, c# -> csharp, .net -> dotnet). Ambiguous words (go, c, swift, express, spring, rails) appear only inside phrases. implies: rules of the implied technology are on-topic too (a Next.js prompt wants React rules). packages: dependency names in manifests. files: glob patterns at the project top level (or one level down) that indicate the technology.",
